--- !u!114 &850738759
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 850738757}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Cats do have nine lives, as they say; always seeming to land on their
    feet!\n\nFor Sylvan though, she has always struggled to find that footing. Wandering
    around, an orphan among the orphans of the nocturnal streets. A ghostly life
    dancing through tall shadows, avoiding the most thuggish denizens of the night...\n\r\nThat
    is, until a dodderishly out-of-sorts frog found himself amongst those very same
    thuggish denizens!\n\nSylvan had been planning to go about her night - it was
    no business of hers - when the shattering of glass echoed off the brickwork of
    the alley, accompanied by a brilliant ochre flash as the thugs surrounding the
    frog fell to their knees, clutching at their eyes.\n\r\nThe frog leapt out from
    between them far more nimbly than he had any right to, by all accounts, and began
    to start onwards about his own night when his eyes fell upon the stray cat hiding
    in the shadows.\n\r\n\u201CHow did you do that?\u201D a small voice whispered
    out. \nA pause. \n\u201CCome with me, and I will show you,\" the frog replied.\n\r\nThus
    began an odd friendship, somewhere between student and teacher, and grandparent
    and child.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
